  "goodToKnow": "Gehorsam means obedient: ein gehorsamer Hund, gehorsam folgen. Der Gehorsam is obedience, and der Kadavergehorsam blind obedience. Because blind obedience enabled Nazi crimes, post-war Germany stresses that soldiers must refuse illegal orders (Innere Führung, the concept of the citizen in uniform). Ziviler Ungehorsam (civil disobedience) is much debated. Gehorchen means to obey, from hören."
